──────────────────────────────────────────────────
Wayland anchoring (layer-shell), woof-CE / Puppy Linux line
──────────────────────────────────────────────────

Written in gtkdialog at woof-CE, then carried into gtk3dialog (01micko),
which BunsenLabs packages; sermo ported it from the latter. Full history:
HISTOIRE.en.md.

Dima Krasner <dima@dimakrasner.com>
  - Wayland layer-shell anchoring in woof-CE gtkdialog (2021)

Mick Amadio (01micko) <01micko@gmail.com>
  - Wayland layer-shell anchoring, continued (2021-2024); author of gtk3dialog

